    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free base game includes the first playable chapter. Future chapters will be released as paid DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Rico Ch\u00e9, a rising sharpshooter on a mission! In the atmospheric depths of a shadowy city, danger lurks at every turn. Outsmart your adversaries as you unravel the secrets hidden around Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop. Arm yourself with a variety of weapons to gain the upper hand\u2014but beware, your enemies are more dangerous than they appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Outside Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most renowned gun store in the city, Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop serves everyone\u2014from first-time buyers to veteran marksmen perfecting their craft. But beneath its unassuming storefront lies a deeper mystery. Rumored to be a covert training ground, its secrets are yours to uncover\u2014if you can find a way inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind the gates of the parking lot, behold the bustling city streets, where random passersby roam and cars cruise through the fog-drenched night, bringing the world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/d6243e3fa107bef71391aecc18c07a36.avif?t=1736281328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Parking Lot Dwellers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters strolling in Hobbe\u2019s Parking Lot may seem friendly \u2014until you give them a reason not to be. From the casual citizens to the sharp-eyed security guard and the deadly Gunslinger, there\u2019s plenty to deal with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy their quirky lines and bold personalities, but don\u2019t get too close\u2014the Sharpshooter isn\u2019t one to miss.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/b520da228802d92817bdc52699eb6698.avif?t=1736281328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Derelict Gate</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadowy fence stands tall beside Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop, locked tight and long forgotten by the bustling city around it. Its origins are unclear, but those with ambition and resourcefulness seem to have claimed the area for their own pursuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind the gate? Perhaps the answer isn\u2019t what you expect\u2014but those willing to explore might just uncover the tools they need to make progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/979d165be6e67c8e65f57a8d9e5f72ee.avif?t=1736281328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and dive in\u2014will you uncover the secret behind Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This free base game includes the first playable chapter. Future chapters will be released as paid DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Rico Ch\u00e9, a rising sharpshooter on a mission! In the atmospheric depths of a shadowy city, danger lurks at every turn. Outsmart your adversaries as you unravel the secrets hidden around Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop. Arm yourself with a variety of weapons to gain the upper hand\u2014but beware, your enemies are more dangerous than they appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Outside Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most renowned gun store in the city, Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop serves everyone\u2014from first-time buyers to veteran marksmen perfecting their craft. But beneath its unassuming storefront lies a deeper mystery. Rumored to be a covert training ground, its secrets are yours to uncover\u2014if you can find a way inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind the gates of the parking lot, behold the bustling city streets, where random passersby roam and cars cruise through the fog-drenched night, bringing the world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/d6243e3fa107bef71391aecc18c07a36.avif?t=1736281328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Parking Lot Dwellers</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters strolling in Hobbe\u2019s Parking Lot may seem friendly \u2014until you give them a reason not to be. From the casual citizens to the sharp-eyed security guard and the deadly Gunslinger, there\u2019s plenty to deal with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy their quirky lines and bold personalities, but don\u2019t get too close\u2014the Sharpshooter isn\u2019t one to miss.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/b520da228802d92817bdc52699eb6698.avif?t=1736281328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Derelict Gate</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadowy fence stands tall beside Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop, locked tight and long forgotten by the bustling city around it. Its origins are unclear, but those with ambition and resourcefulness seem to have claimed the area for their own pursuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie behind the gate? Perhaps the answer isn\u2019t what you expect\u2014but those willing to explore might just uncover the tools they need to make progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373400/extras/979d165be6e67c8e65f57a8d9e5f72ee.avif?t=1736281328\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up and dive in\u2014will you uncover the secret behind Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A low-poly first-person shooter with challenging combat, realistic bullet-drop physics, and cartoony characters. Navigate a foggy urban lot, solve puzzles to uncover secrets, and face quirky foes with bold personalities. Can you crack the mystery of Hobbe\u2019s Gun Shop?",
